## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gamepad Reticle Customizer
## Notes: Customizes the controller's reticle: its shape, size, color and border, and an icon on a target (a player's class, a sword on enemies that grays out of reach, a raid marker). Settings in Options > AddOns > Gamepad Reticle Customizer, or /gprc.
